    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-3.5-flash:generateContent",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"contents\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"parts\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"You are a lead qualification assistant for a small business. Classify the inbound lead below as Hot, Warm, or Cold using this exact rubric:\\n\\nHOT: Explicit buying intent (\\\"I want to book,\\\" \\\"ready to start,\\\" \\\"sign me up\\\"); a specific timeline (\\\"this week,\\\" \\\"by Friday,\\\" \\\"ASAP\\\"); budget or pricing tier already named or asked for directly and specifically; identifies themselves as the decision-maker; asks about next steps, contracts, or availability rather than general info.\\n\\nDo NOT score Hot if the message contains hedging or conditional language (\\\"if we can find the right fit,\\\" \\\"planning to,\\\" \\\"thinking about,\\\" \\\"might\\\") even alongside a timeline or pricing question \u2014 that combination is Warm, not Hot. A timeline alone is not sufficient for Hot without accompanying commitment language showing the decision is already made.\\n\\nWARM: Genuine interest but still exploring (\\\"looking into options,\\\" \\\"comparing a few providers\\\"); asks specific questions about services/pricing/process without committing language; no stated timeline or a vague one (\\\"sometime soon\\\"); engaged and detailed, not decision-ready yet.\\n\\nCOLD: Vague or generic inquiry with little specific detail; information-gathering only (\\\"just curious,\\\" \\\"what do you guys do\\\"); no timeline, budget, or role indicated; reads as templated, unrelated to services, or spam-like.\\n\\nLead message:\\n{{ $json.message }}\\n\\nOutput ONLY valid JSON, no markdown fences, no preamble, in this exact structure:\\n{\\\"score\\\": \\\"Hot\\\" | \\\"Warm\\\" | \\\"Cold\\\", \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"one sentence citing the specific signal(s) from the message that drove this score\\\", \\\"keySignals\\\": [\\\"short phrase\\\", \\\"short phrase\\\"], \\\"hedgingLanguagePresent\\\": true | false}\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"generationConfig\": {\n    \"responseMimeType\": \"application/json\",\n    \"maxOutputTokens\": 2000,\n    \"temperature\": 0.2\n  }\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        896,
        -144
      ],
      "id": "5e87853b-d818-4110-96f7-8ad678531dc0",
      "name": "Classify Lead",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "lrMYcyYCdAHKrL5Q",
          "name": "Gemini API"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
